--Description:  
--  Before we can pull the 2017 ACS employment-rate figure, we must learn the exact
--  table and column names that store that statistic inside FDA.CENSUS_UTILITY.  
--  The idea: scan FDA.INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMNS for any table in the
